<title>ITALY: Giribaldi ups stake in Italy's Cofide.</title>
<headline>Giribaldi ups stake in Italy's Cofide.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monaco-based businessman Luigi Giribaldi has raised his stake in Carlo De Benedetti's financial holding group Cofide to 20.05 percent, said a Cofide statement.</p>
<p>Giribaldi's stake is held through the Monaco-based Banque du Gothard. On November 8, Giribaldi said he had raised his Cofide stake to 15.86 percent.</p>
<p>De Benedetti and a syndicate of shareholders still holds 56.7 percent of the shares in Cofide.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
